  "_note": "Class-level metric priors for the COCO-80 vocabulary -- the closed set the CBD generator's MediaPipe object detector emits. Closed vocabulary is why this file can be complete rather than a growing pile of special cases, and why the adapter needs no language model to know how big a chair is.",
